In general, all unpolarized quantities show good agreement with the simulated sample of events and are behaving as predicted. The calculation of asymmetry now took place, as described in the Data analysis chapter. The results for each bin have been integrated over all energies for \(x_{\rm F}>0.3\). The result is given in figure 5.26.

